---
title: "transfer (Compound V2: cTokens)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_comptroller: transferAllowed(cToken, src, dst, amount)
    q_comptroller --> q_error_comptroller: comptroller rejected
    q_error_comptroller --> [*]: return TRANSFER_COMPTROLLER_REJECTION
    q_comptroller --> q_check_balance: check accountTokens[src] >= amount
    q_check_balance --> q_error_balance: insufficient balance
    q_error_balance --> [*]: return TRANSFER_NOT_ENOUGH
    q_check_balance --> q_check_liquidity: check account liquidity remains non-negative
    q_check_liquidity --> q_error_liquidity: would cause negative liquidity
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: return TRANSFER_TOO_MUCH
    q_check_liquidity --> q_update_src: accountTokens[src] = accountTokens[src] - amount
    q_update_src --> q_update_dst: accountTokens[dst] = accountTokens[dst] + amount
    q_update_dst --> q_emit: emit Transfer(src, dst, amount)
    q_emit --> [*]: return true

    note right of q_check_balance
        INV-001: accountTokens[src] >= amount (sufficient balance)
        INV-002: src != dst (no self-transfer issues)
    end note

    note right of q_check_liquidity
        INV-003: if src has entered market, liquidity must remain >= 0
        INV-004: sum of all accountTokens is conserved (no tokens created or destroyed)
        INV-005: totalSupply unchanged by transfer
    end note
